SUMMARY:Collegium Annual General Meeting
DESCRIPTION:Reminder: The USMC Collegium welcomes community members to be present at all annual and regular meetings as public observers. However\, observers are not participants in the meetings. As stated in USMC By-Law 9.9\, “a person who is not a member of the Collegium shall not be entitled to speak at a meeting unless invited by the chair of the meeting.” \n\n\n\n(USMC By-Law 9.9).
